<title>USA: United Tech gets $485 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>United Tech gets $485 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp has received a $485 million U.S. defense contract for kits to upgrade F100-PW and 200 engines to the F100-PW-22E configuration for use on F-15 and F-16 fighter jets, the Air Force said.</p>
<p>The contract is expected to be completed in June of 2003.</p>
</text>
